      "sceneKind": "timeline",
      "startSec": 35.8,
      "durationSec": 21.4,
      "narration": "The evidence goes back to 1909, but a clear modern test came in 2006. Two researchers asked students to either reread a passage or practice recalling it. One week later, the recall group remembered substantially more. A 2017 review of dozens of experiments found the same pattern across ages and subjects.",
